Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ImageAdvisor is written in Go. The binary contains:

- the Go standard library, BSD-3-Clause license, Copyright The Go Authors;
- go-yaml, the YAML parser, MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses, see its repository.

The Linux container images are built FROM scratch and contain only the
ImageAdvisor binary. The Windows container images add the binary to
mcr.microsoft.com/windows/nanoserver, which Microsoft licenses under its own
terms (see the image on the Microsoft Artifact Registry); using a Windows image
means accepting them.
